      "text": "For the activation matrix X, it finds the\nabsolute maximum for each row:\n\n\n\nFor the weight matrix \\(W\\), it finds the\nabsolute maximum for each column:\n\n\n\nThe scale in this case is therefore:\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
