      "updated": 1789421668199,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the original GPTQ paper, they use uniform per-row asymmetric\nmin–max quantization. So for one row of weights \\(w\\), you take:\n\n\n\n\n\nFor a \\(b\\)-bit quantizer, the integer range has roughly\n\n\n\n\n\nsteps, so the scale is",
      "fontSize": 18.00385544617052,
