      "text": "GPTQ tries to minimize something like:\n\n\n\n\nbut then it modifies other weights to compensate using Hessian information.\nAWQ instead searches for a better parameterization:\n\n\n\n\nThe weights themselves are not reconstructed si it uses a single parameter \\(\\alpha\\) to control the\nprotection strength.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GPTQ tries to minimize something like:\n\n\n\n\nbut then it modifies other weights to compensate using Hessian information.\nAWQ instead searches for a better parameterization:\n\n\n\n\nThe weights themselves are not reconstructed si it uses a single parameter \\(\\alpha\\) to control the protection strength.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
