      "updated": 1789421702582,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the delta is only dependent on the\nmaxium weghts in the channel and it is\nvery unlikely that in the block of 128,\nscaling one channel will modify this.\nTherefore have ∆' ≈ ∆",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the delta is only dependent on the maxium weghts in the channel and it is very unlikely that in the block of 128, scaling one channel will modify this. Therefore have ∆' ≈ ∆",
