      "link": "https://www.deeplearning.ai/the-batch/how-metas-llama-nlp-model-leaked",
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Context:\nBack in the days LLMs were still not released to the general audiace.\nOn February 24th 2022, Meta had offered LLaMA to researchers at\ninstitutions, government agencies, and nongovernmental organizations\nwho requested access and agreed to a noncommercial license. A week\nlater, 4chan leaked it.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Context:\nBack in the days LLMs were still not released to the general audiace. On February 24th 2022, Meta had offered LLaMA to researchers at institutions, government agencies, and nongovernmental organizations who requested access and agreed to a noncommercial license. A week later, 4chan leaked it.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
