    {
      "id": "GgrUZkS81rXrS0uvj2bGo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3852.592232747855,
      "y": 11021.10269850171,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "iBX_Jz_HpqdeUVvhey4_D",
        "KvAS_QnhHp7QT_PtiVVd2",
        "jlfZ8rE6zfya4Cjd_rDFa"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bVm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517304058,
      "version": 6977,
      "versionNonce": 1698842576,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789421757277,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| Quantization | Nominal bits | Effective bits / weight | Block structure             | Importance matrix |\n| ------------ | -----------: | ----------------------: | --------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **IQ4_NL**   |        4-bit |  Not stated on the page | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ4_XS**   |        4-bit |            **4.25 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ3_S**    |        3-bit |            **3.44 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ3_XXS**  |        3-bit |            **3.06 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ2_S**    |        2-bit |            **2.50 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ2_XS**   |        2-bit |            **2.31 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ2_XXS**  |        2-bit |            **2.06 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ1_M**    |        1-bit |            **1.75 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ1_S**    |        1-bit |            **1.56 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| Quantization | Nominal bits | Effective bits / weight | Block structure             | Importance matrix |\n| ------------ | -----------: | ----------------------: | --------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| **IQ4_NL**   |        4-bit |  Not stated on the page | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ4_XS**   |        4-bit |            **4.25 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ3_S**    |        3-bit |            **3.44 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ3_XXS**  |        3-bit |            **3.06 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ2_S**    |        2-bit |            **2.50 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ2_XS**   |        2-bit |            **2.31 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ2_XXS**  |        2-bit |            **2.06 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ1_M**    |        1-bit |            **1.75 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |\n| **IQ1_S**    |        1-bit |            **1.56 bpw** | Super-blocks of 256 weights | Yes               |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1789077885709,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
