    {
      "id": "OvzmopReG3MOpjGYABJ7p",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -13229.041288040135,
      "y": 4433.537070942383,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 725,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3IX4_2QWAlkrSu0Gme3CG",
        "RUHXPKd16HvGggw-aAMcw",
        "IjPbrq0Y3xxIlUgmObAkq",
        "2BSV0B04mK-tRxLppZJv1"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "biS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1142959206,
      "version": 2542,
      "versionNonce": 1124509854,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789588462878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Neural networks can be represented a matrix multiplication between the input (also called activations)\nand the hidden states (the learned weights) of the network summed by the bias.\nThe goal of quantizations is to bring the weights, activations and bias to a lower precision, more\nspecifically we want to perform all operatons using integer arithmetic which is much faster to floating\npoint operations.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOnce all the operations are concluded, we also need to dequantize the output in such a way that the\nhigh precision neural network and the quantized one would output similar values.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Neural networks can be represented a matrix multiplication between the input (also called activations) and the hidden states (the learned weights) of the network summed by the bias.\nThe goal of quantizations is to bring the weights, activations and bias to a lower precision, more specifically we want to perform all operatons using integer arithmetic which is much faster to floating point operations.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOnce all the operations are concluded, we also need to dequantize the output in such a way that the high precision neural network and the quantized one would output similar values.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1789071380093,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
